 "status": "sections_found",
 "title": "Andy Barr",
 "intro": "Andy Barr (Republican Party) is a member of the U.S. House, representing Kentucky's 6th Congressional District. He assumed office on January 3, 2013. His current term ends on January 3, 2027. Barr is not running for re-election to U.S. House Kentucky District 6 in 2026.\nBarr (Republican Party) is running for election to the U.S. Senate to represent Kentucky. He is on the ballot in the general election on November 3, 2026. He advanced from the Republican primary on May 19, 2026.",
